      "fork_message": "Preserve relocatable ATen and correct c10d socket diagnostics\n\nRebase the owned ATen CMake relocation and socket diagnostic corrections onto\nthe source for the official 2026-11-11 PyTorch nightly. Keep the synchronous\nTCPStore backend and all upstream allocation and transport contracts intact.\nUse the actual socket address and host-order port for numeric diagnostics,\nand a relaxed atomic DNS policy flag with local successful lookup results.\n\nTest Plan:\n```bash\ngit apply --check /canonical/deploy/v100/framework-patches/0001-owned-aten-and-socket-corrections.patch\ngit diff --check\n```\n\nPrepared with an AI assistant. No upstream publication.\n",
